      "title": "5-Year Outlook: Can Domino's Pizza Deliver?",
      "summary": "Domino's Pizza receives a Superscore of 85 out of 100, reflecting its asset-light franchise model, digital dominance (85% digital sales), and strong capital returns. However, the stock faces headwinds from slowing same-store sales, intensifying competition from delivery aggregators, market saturation with 22,700+ locations, and elevated valuation at 19.09 P/E. Future growth depends on international expansion and continued digital innovation, with the pizza market expected to grow 10%+ CAGR through 2031.",
