      "title": "Domino's Strong Order Trends vs. Weak Ticket Growth: What Lies Ahead?",
      "summary": "Domino's Pizza reported Q3 2026 U.S. same-store sales growth of 0.3%, driven by strong order count increases that offset declining average ticket sizes due to consumer spending pressures. The company is implementing value promotions and new products like The Domino to boost ticket growth, while expecting continued order momentum in Q4 but sales near the lower end of guidance. Domino's shares have outperformed the broader market, trading at a lower valuation than industry peers.",
